issue('target-observation-scope','Section 2 assumes A contains 0 and fully observed target data. Section 3 expressly allows an unobserved target Q. Theorem 1 still writes conditional expectations given A=0 in Delta; that notation requires clarification in the general unobserved-target case.',[7,10,17])
