issue('bound-uniformity','The finite-sample branch quantifies over all n,k,v and refers to the bound on lambda-hat. It does not separately spell out whether one deterministic envelope is uniform in all indices and realizations; the constants are stated to depend only on epsilon, P_* and that bound.',[17,18])
